        <category>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[BPO]]></Value>
    </category>
        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[When someone places an order, asks “Where is my delivery” late at night via chat, or returns a package after a flash sale, the real engine behind a seamless experience is usually offscreen. In 2025, brands that sell direct to consumers must juggle big support volumes, rising return rates, and high expectations … all while keeping operations lean.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
